# cmd.exe cannot reliably parse LF-only batch files. When bin/rap.cmd was
# rewritten with LF endings (2026-08-14, during the rp -> rap rename), cmd
# mis-split the last line and launched `powershell` with NO arguments: an
# interactive shell that printed nothing and waited on stdin forever, which
# looked like "rap stopped showing anything". Pin batch wrappers to CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
